<ServiceLayout
  h1="Custom Architectural Presentation Models"
  seoTitle="Custom Architectural Presentation Models | Disha Associates, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar"
  seoDescription="Bespoke architectural presentation scale models built for a specific competition, exhibition, approval or investor meeting, by Disha Associates in Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar, Maharashtra."
  path="/architectural-model-making/"
  crumbLabel="Custom Presentation Models"
  eyebrow="Custom presentation models"
  lead="Purpose-built architectural models tailored to a specific presentation, competition, exhibition or stakeholder meeting — scale, detail and finish agreed with you."
  image="/images/service-custom.svg"
  imageAlt="Placeholder illustration of a bespoke architectural presentation scale model on a studio display table"
  serviceName="Custom Architectural Presentation Models"
  highlights={highlights}
  faqIndices={[0, 3, 5, 6]}
>
  <p>
    Some projects don't fit a standard category. A competition entry may have its own
    rules, an exhibition may demand a higher standard of finish, and an approval meeting
    may hinge on one particular design move. For these situations we build fully custom
    presentation models shaped around the job the model has to do.
  </p>
  <p>
    We start from the presentation context — who will see the model, what decision or
    reaction it needs to support, and where it will be displayed. From there we agree the
    scale, level of detail, materials, display base and any removable sections or lighting.
  </p>
  <p>
    The result is a model made for one purpose and made well: a one-off piece that presents
    a specific design with clarity and confidence.
  </p>
</ServiceLayout>
